# L1-NEXT: exited with 0
# reads of an assigned object
# L2: 40460000 40460000 40460000 5000 5000 host,port,secure,depth,more 1 host,port,secure,depth,more 1
# L2-NEXT: 809200000
# L2-NEXT: a turn: 0 calls into the run time, at most 12.9 instructions
